WEBVTT

00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:19,350
Or coconut products, okay, for a low histamine diet, you know, that's, again, that's something

00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:26,630
that you, like if you Google foods with high histamine in it, you could, you could pull up

00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:30,590
like six different articles, and there's six different lists, although there'll be some

00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:35,590
common things in each list, but sometimes you'll go, this list has this and it doesn't have,

00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:38,590
this list doesn't have that in it.

00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:48,350
Because if you do organic assay of products to test for histamines, you know, I've said this

00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:53,950
before, it's, sometimes it's very different because it depends on how old the product

00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:57,630
is, et cetera, and how many histamines are in it.

00:00:57,630 --> 00:01:02,310
So the percentage of histamines in a product is based upon the age of the product is just

00:01:02,310 --> 00:01:08,910
based upon the, you know, the sample that you got of that product.

00:01:08,910 --> 00:01:10,950
Coconut is that high in histamines?

00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:14,590
I don't think it's generally high in histamines.

00:01:14,590 --> 00:01:19,550
So, but you know, if you eat too much of anything, you can have problems.

00:01:19,550 --> 00:01:27,430
So, but, you know, is coconut oil a substitute for some other things, or could I have coconut

00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:30,070
in a meal that I make?

00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:35,470
Yeah, I think that would be typically fine on a high histamine diet within a reason.

